{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're standing on the edge of a beach where the waves don't wash up seashells or seafoam, but plastic bottles, torn bags, and rusted metal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A choice you once made brought you here. Now your debts and mistakes have become your sentence: long, grueling work under the scorching sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, it feels simple - pick up the trash, bag it, drag it to the drop-off. But step by step, you realize the beach never ends. Behind every pile of waste lies not only someone else's mess, but your own. Sometimes you come across things that feel like treasures - not the kind worth money, but items that once meant the world to someone. Worthless, yet carrying entire stories within them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you are a convict paying for the past through labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort and haul the garbage, feel the fatigue and the heat, and fight with your own doubts. With every bag, you get closer to clearing your debt - and maybe, to a second chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beach is your trial. The work is your punishment. And freedom will be your reward.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860890?t=1769117059","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860890?t=1769117059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860890/038fee140fd8e5447c1da2573f1b795233eb9e4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769117059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860890/038fee140fd8e5447c1da2573f1b795233eb9e4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769117059","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3973170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're standing on the edge of a beach where the waves don't wash up seashells or seafoam, but plastic bottles, torn bags, and rusted metal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A choice you once made brought you here. Now your debts and mistakes have become your sentence: long, grueling work under the scorching sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, it feels simple - pick up the trash, bag it, drag it to the drop-off. But step by step, you realize the beach never ends. Behind every pile of waste lies not only someone else's mess, but your own. Sometimes you come across things that feel like treasures - not the kind worth money, but items that once meant the world to someone. Worthless, yet carrying entire stories within them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you are a convict paying for the past through labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort and haul the garbage, feel the fatigue and the heat, and fight with your own doubts. With every bag, you get closer to clearing your debt - and maybe, to a second chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beach is your trial. The work is your punishment. And freedom will be your reward.</p>","developers":["KOMA"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860890/0056a8cf00b4cd63bed96137eb69545250a53411/header.jpg?t=1769117059","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<stron